Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.32,0:00:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.78,0:00:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.84,0:00:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna burn to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.84,0:00:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see any of us dying from these\Ntemps, but I hope I don't overheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.84,0:00:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be okay, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.82,0:00:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all because of that sheer pervert?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.15,0:00:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heavy's letter is the reason\Nwe're here in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We came here to track him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must leave you and go see to a\Npersonal matter, but fear not comrades!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.56,0:00:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall rejoin you as soon as\Nmy errand is taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.08,0:00:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,P .S.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.14,0:00:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care of yourselves and of\Ncourse your footwear This letter
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.02,0:00:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,must mean that he's headed for\Nthe Scorching Sand Stratum,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.78,0:00:40.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.69,0:00:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably based on how he acted yesterday\NThen it would be best if we followed him,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:45.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.01,0:00:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I personally don't care at\Nall that much about Heavy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.66,0:00:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'd like to check up on\Nthe Scorching Sand Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.86,0:00:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's fine by me if we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, there you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.98,0:00:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here we are in the\Nscorching sand stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.54,0:00:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'd better do something before\Neveryone melts in this intense heat.
