Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.86,0:01:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll turn on my temperature\Nregulation feature.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.12,0:01:00.62,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (right top),0,0,0,,{\an4\fs9\3c&H371710&\pos(471,76)\t(276,277,\c&H67423D&\3c&HF8F0F4&)\t(651,652,\3c&H371710&\c&HF9F0F3&)}Keep Warm
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.12,0:01:00.62,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (right bottom),0,0,0,,{\an4\fs9\3c&H371710&\t(651,652,\c&H67423D&\3c&HF8F0F4&)\pos(473,133)}Keep Cold
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.90,0:01:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, things just cool\Ndown a lot. Thanks, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.98,0:01:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, fair Lamas, I want some cool too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.00,0:01:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This cold is just what the Boxxo\Nordered. Yeah, right? I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.24,0:01:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll wear that cloak Boxo got\Nme in the dark forest stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.22,0:01:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that she should need to use\Nanother heat countermeasure,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.78,0:01:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Llamas is being nice and making it\Na point to wear the cloak I gave her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.90,0:01:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Boxxo, how do I look?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.88,0:01:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ad or a bo-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.16,0:01:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.54,0:01:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It pays to compliment her when\Nshe responds so, well, adorably.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.42,0:01:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's no time for\Nsoothing our discomfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.32,0:01:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to go to the Hunters Association\Nand deliver the letter from Director Bear.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.08,0:01:43.00,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(1773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.38,0:01:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the outside, I'm just a big metal box,\NBut inside I've still got a human soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.16,0:01:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this new world of\Nwonders I travel to and
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.30,0:01:56.26,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(1773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.30,0:01:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fro on the back of my\Nsuper strong partner Lamas!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.86,0:01:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name's Boxxo! Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.50,0:01:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means yes, by the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.24,0:02:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.09,0:03:16.97,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(357,450)\fscx70\pos(455.2,52.4)}Into the Scorching Desert
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.32,0:03:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here from the\NClearflow Lake Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.78,0:03:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a letter from the director there,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.92,0:03:21.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we'd like to deliver it to\NDirector Scorching if we could.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.88,0:03:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My word, Master Boxo, it can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.68,0:03:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen you in so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.30,0:03:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sincerest apologies if I worried you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.80,0:03:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.10,0:03:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mishuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.24,0:03:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did sort of forget\Nabout him, to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.78,0:03:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oops, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.38,0:03:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, anyway, now I've caught up\Nwith everyone who got scattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.44,0:03:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got sent to this place by myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.32,0:03:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and as I was pondering how\NI had no way to get back,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.86,0:03:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ended up helping defend the village\Nwhen a swarm of monsters attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.06,0:03:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.98,0:03:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, everyone else is safe\Nback in the Clearflow Lake stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.38,0:03:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm relieved to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.82,0:03:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad we ran into Mishuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.92,0:04:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder how he's been faring\Non his own in this stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.76,0:04:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's hoping his communication\Nissues have improved a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.68,0:04:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's such a relief you're here, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.84,0:04:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the stress and tension these past\Nfew days have really wrecked my stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.92,0:04:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrecked it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.02,0:04:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It did nothing for your looks, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.08,0:04:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess there's no way you were\Ngoing to improve that quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.98,0:04:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The director says he will see you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.68,0:04:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome, friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.76,0:04:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.12,0:04:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although this stratum has had\Nits own fair share of weirdness,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.78,0:04:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what with the monster swarm\Nattacking the village and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.26,0:04:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we fought them all off, caught what\Nappeared to be their commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.10,0:04:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and threw their butts in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.80,0:04:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.34,0:04:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, um, we have a letter here\Nfor you from Director Bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.56,0:04:40.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.54,0:04:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see that you guys have\Nhad it pretty rough as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.48,0:04:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.39,0:04:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can provide us with water? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.80,0:04:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This heat has the Oasis low on\Nwater and things are looking bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.96,0:04:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I ask for it right away?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.52,0:04:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.10,0:04:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since I started doing business on\Nthis stratum with its horrible heat,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.44,0:05:00.49,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(195,20)\fad(500,1)\3c&HDAFF9B&}Megumi Natural Water
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.56,0:05:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the cold drinks have been flying\Noff the proverbial shelves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.58,0:05:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Been selling with no breaks from dawn\Ntill dusk every day without fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.40,0:05:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Busy day, huh, Boxo? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.60,0:05:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do after this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.58,0:05:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shooey's gone off somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.00,0:05:12.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.91,0:05:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you maybe want to go check out the magic\Nitem shop that was selling those boots?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.26,0:05:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.34,0:05:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some sightseeing at night could be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.46,0:05:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.74,0:05:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of magic item this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.62,0:05:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.53,0:05:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that one allows you to\Nclean your bathwater and
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.98,0:05:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,store it in a bucket so\Nyou can use it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.24,0:05:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like Lamas is\Ngoing to do some shopping
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.30,0:05:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before hitting up the\Nmerchant for information.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.82,0:05:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that would really come in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.94,0:05:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to buy it, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.52,0:05:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you for your business, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.22,0:05:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've really been in luck lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.54,0:05:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the third new customer\Nwho's coming today alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.20,0:05:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would the others be a man\Ndressed like a clergyman
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.68,0:05:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and a short-haired woman\Nwith a bow on her back?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.28,0:05:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, um, yes, as a matter of fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.00,0:05:51.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.91,0:05:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know them, miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.83,0:05:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.74,0:05:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did they have to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.74,0:05:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the clergyman had questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.90,0:05:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He asked where I'd gotten\Nsome boots I sold recently,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.22,0:06:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then he left, but that\Ninformation is confidential.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.38,0:06:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was heavy, no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.50,0:06:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure, but would you mind telling me\Nwhich hunter sold you those boots, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.42,0:06:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.33,0:06:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to think of my reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.16,0:06:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like disclosure of personal info\Nis problematic even in this other world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.34,0:06:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case... Letter. What? Letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.08,0:06:20.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean those letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.80,0:06:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.71,0:06:26.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got letters of introduction from the\Ndirector here and one from Suori, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.92,0:06:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.36,0:06:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one's from Director\NScorching and what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.56,0:06:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One from that giant corporation, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.40,0:06:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suori's letter had an even bigger\Neffect than Director Scorching's?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.74,0:06:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.65,0:06:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sawari calling herself the daughter of a
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.46,0:06:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,big-time merchant might\Nbe an understatement.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.86,0:06:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make an exception\Nand tell you this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.24,0:06:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no surviving in this business\Nif you cross those two, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.72,0:06:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The salesman is scared out of her wits.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.92,0:06:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm very curious to know\Nwhat was in that letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.38,0:06:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one who sold the\Nboots to me was Tashtay,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.14,0:06:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a hunter who's pretty\Nactive on the stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.98,0:06:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.89,0:07:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, why couldn't you have invited me to\Njoin you on your evening stroll tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.64,0:07:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I dine alone, women always end up\Napproaching me and it stresses me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.12,0:07:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fun thing about Mishuel\Nis that he's being sincere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.62,0:07:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am being sarcastic, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.34,0:07:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, in any case, I asked Director\NScorching about this hunter called Tashtay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.96,0:07:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, he's the leader of a hunter\Nteam known as the Billowing Flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.46,0:07:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They number around a dozen in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.54,0:07:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was told they're\Ncurrently exploring some
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.44,0:07:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ruins in a desert region of this stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.44,0:07:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.88,0:07:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wish to parlay with this Tashtay,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.24,0:07:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then it seems your only option\Nis to make for the ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.64,0:07:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But going there would mean having to\Ncross that awful desert, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.82,0:07:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.12,0:07:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.72,0:07:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Master Boxo, would you mind\Nterribly if I accompanied you, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.30,0:07:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish he wouldn't look at\Nme like an abandoned puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.24,0:07:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to handle this skillfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.00,0:07:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be here to ask for you, Apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.14,0:07:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Boxo called me his apprentice!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.08,0:07:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything, you name it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.28,0:07:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.19,0:08:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you planning to disappear again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.86,0:08:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you trying to deal\Nwith this all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.64,0:08:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have our issues, but\Nwe're all on the same side.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.04,0:08:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a personal matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.54,0:08:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I simply don't wish to inconvenience...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.50,0:08:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you go, deciding on your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.66,0:08:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without even discussing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.34,0:08:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like Captain Carry Oil!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.10,0:08:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're doing what he did!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.18,0:08:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm just not trustworthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.22,0:08:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.78,0:08:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if he had been honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.46,0:08:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maybe these could have turned out\Ndifferently and we'd all be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.82,0:08:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, Shui.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.92,0:08:29.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you all came here\Nin search of me, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.58,0:08:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am deeply sorry to have\Ncaused you such trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.10,0:08:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you think you've caused trouble,\Nthen I want you to talk it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.60,0:08:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right. You leaving without\Nsaying anything is what made us worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.44,0:08:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.64,0:08:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt you'll like this story,\Nbut are you willing to hear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.28,0:08:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.88,0:08:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It happened back before I\Njoined the Menagerie of Fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.24,0:08:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A childhood friend and I\Nwere working as hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.62,0:09:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We knew each other well and\Nmade an incredible team.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.12,0:09:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People were lauding us as\Nthe next up-and-coming duo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.54,0:09:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Heavy had a partner before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.98,0:09:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One day, after a series of lucky breaks,\NI received a surprisingly hefty reward?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.90,0:09:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I decided to get my friend some\Nnew boots for her upcoming birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.38,0:09:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those boots were the untiring God's feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.62,0:09:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The boots I won were the\Nsame ones you gave her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.14,0:09:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.64,0:09:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She, my friend, was pleased with them too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.00,0:09:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She wore those boots everywhere\Nshe went, without fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.54,0:09:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She would always say she'd never\Ngive them up no matter what,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.22,0:09:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and she said it with a smile every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.94,0:09:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heavy's expression speaks volumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.06,0:09:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no question how\Nimportant his friend was to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.40,0:09:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not long after,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.98,0:09:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we were attacked by bandits while\Non assignment escorting a merchant,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.56,0:09:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and a blow from an adversary\Nleft me unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.26,0:09:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I came to, I was greeted by the\Nhorrible sight of corpses all around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.18,0:10:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There before my eyes were my friend's\Nremains, her legs cut off at the knees,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.32,0:10:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hewn off crudely, cruelly, with\Nan axe or other rough blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.62,0:10:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My heart broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.98,0:10:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She had tied them too tightly\Nbecause they meant so much to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the bandits couldn't\Nget them off of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.88,0:10:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They wore masks so I\Ndon't know their faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.38,0:10:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only clue was that\Npair of boots they stole.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.06,0:10:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so, clinging to hope,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.94,0:10:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I became obsessed with footwear,\Nsingle-minded in my quest for vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.10,0:10:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That brings us to now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.42,0:10:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never expected Heavy to\Nhave such a tragic hero past.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may be a clergyman, but my heart has\Nbeen full of naught but revenge ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.94,0:10:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pathetic when you\Nconsider the judgment
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.90,0:10:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doled out to Captain\NKerioyl and his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.54,0:10:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.72,0:10:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both you and the captain,\Nyou're total dumbasses!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.32,0:10:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you had talked about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.90,0:10:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we might have found the boots and\Nthe people who sold them much sooner!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.62,0:10:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you had shared your own sad story,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.76,0:10:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they might have been willing to\Ntalk about their family problems?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.12,0:10:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we'd still be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.06,0:10:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but this is my personal business.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.88,0:10:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you yes, but me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.79,0:11:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you see things turned out this way\Nbecause everyone's so full of secrets?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.14,0:11:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of the lies and deception.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.16,0:11:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really this simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.46,0:11:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want help, all you have to do is\Nexplain the situation and ask for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.48,0:11:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's too much or I don't\Nwant to do it, I'll say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.82,0:11:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If what you're doing is wrong, as a\Ncomrade, I'll do all I can to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I wish you'd stop deciding and be a\Nburden or that you already know my answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.08,0:11:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's infuriating.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.08,0:11:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right. I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.30,0:11:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My fear made everything much worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.68,0:11:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, Shui.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.26,0:11:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.17,0:11:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't sweat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.22,0:11:36.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad that you get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.66,0:11:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, might I request your assistance?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.56,0:11:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The answer is obvious! Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.90,0:11:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got your back, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.16,0:11:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At your service! Oh, fine. I'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.82,0:11:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.54,0:11:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.95,0:12:01.95,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,text,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(189,1)\an8\fs20\pos(496,184)}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.80,0:12:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.30,0:12:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.28,0:12:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our first obstacle is finding a\Nway through the scorching desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.74,0:12:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The environment is so harsh that even\Nwalking through it will be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.48,0:12:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if that magic\Nitem shop has anything
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.98,0:12:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that could maybe help\Nus deal with the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.94,0:12:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you're in a bind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.32,0:12:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did you get here, Hulemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.88,0:12:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.79,0:12:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't had time to unpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.22,0:12:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wanted to come along, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.10,0:12:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to be okay in this heat?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.58,0:12:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may be a snow fairy, but I'm not\Ngoing to melt if it gets too hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.32,0:12:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I can cool down\Nthe air if I need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.46,0:12:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for the temperature problem,\NI have a solution for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.76,0:12:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This magic item has the effect of\Nblocking heat and cooling nearby moisture.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.78,0:12:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll turn any sweat and\Nhumidity into a refreshing mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.18,0:12:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simply incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.54,0:12:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With that item, I bet we'd be able\Nto cross the desert with ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.94,0:12:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, these are for Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.52,0:12:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're from the Dark\NForest Stratum weapons shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.98,0:12:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, they can\Nsomehow change their weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.70,0:12:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.64,0:13:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those will make her attacks\Nway stronger and help
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.22,0:13:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her maintain control when\Nshe's going full tilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.24,0:13:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm not as worried anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.68,0:13:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I seem to have caused\Nquite the kerfuffle. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.58,0:13:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truth be told, I never\Nplanned on telling anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.48,0:13:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I suppose I ought to think Shui.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.74,0:13:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't have been easy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.06,0:13:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but at least now he's able to unload some\Nof the burdens he's had to carry alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.38,0:13:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not naive enough to\Nthink that everything
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.56,0:13:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will be resolved during this one outing,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.70,0:13:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but maybe I'll find a stopping point.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.10,0:13:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope it works out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.56,0:13:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.84,0:13:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as hot as we expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.78,0:13:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, even hotter, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.44,0:13:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though we're wearing the\Ncloaks Hulemy made for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.82,0:13:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it seems to be tough going for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.34,0:13:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll scratch that, not everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.20,0:13:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a little farther, guys,\Nthen we'll take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.58,0:13:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas and Botan are doing fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.64,0:13:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my temperature regulation\Npowers, Llamas isn't sweating at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.24,0:13:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Botan seems dandy with all\Nthe cold air Kiko is providing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.06,0:14:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.30,0:14:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you could be my boyfriend for\Njust this stratum, that'd be amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.12,0:14:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd even settle for being best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.02,0:14:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come now, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.93,0:14:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.24,0:14:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo is looking more and more attractive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.56,0:14:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, you could just\Nhave me at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.80,0:14:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, master, I'd do anything, you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.20,0:14:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I look close, his\Nbody is like a pair of boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.90,0:14:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snap out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.20,0:14:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more you three talk,\Nthe less sense you make.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.82,0:14:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, this is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.30,0:14:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel alive again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.78,0:14:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave it to Master Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.58,0:14:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect the heat to\Nbe too much for the clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.42,0:14:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like they were useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.92,0:14:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I took mine off, it was so hot,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.84,0:14:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I was going to\Nshrivel up and die right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.24,0:14:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.18,0:14:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that some sort of calendar\Nthey use in this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.60,0:14:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calendar?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:14:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.58,0:14:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say something, Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.54,0:14:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a calendar?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.82,0:15:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those numbers are dates, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.40,0:15:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's exactly it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.22,0:15:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since we had a moment, I\Nwanted to check today's date.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.80,0:15:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.71,0:15:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, one of the dates is circled in red.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.68,0:15:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It marks a certain anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.48,0:15:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.54,0:15:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll leave it at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.80,0:15:18.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't pry into her private affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.80,0:15:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa that's the desert pillar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.88,0:15:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep the desert pillar is supposed to\Nbe huge so it's likely still far off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.28,0:15:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desert pillar is apparently another\Nname for the ruins of an old tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.98,0:15:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's said to be a hundred\Nstories tall and the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.14,0:15:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stratum lord can be found\Non the very top floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.48,0:15:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His black feathers look striking\Nagainst the cloudless sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.88,0:15:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait what? Kuroyata!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.16,0:15:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say you saw him disappear, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.30,0:15:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he vanished into thin air.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.00,0:15:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good to know I wasn't just seeing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.86,0:15:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.40,0:15:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was sure this was the spot, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.04,0:16:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, something seems\Nkind of weird here. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.68,0:16:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Lammis. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.80,0:16:04.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tower's really close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.52,0:16:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's right there in front of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.82,0:16:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.73,0:16:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you looking at me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.82,0:16:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never would have guessed the\Ndesert pillar would be this close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.32,0:16:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like there's some kind of illusion\Nmagic at work, similar to my blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.24,0:16:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes sense, Kuroyata disappeared\Nafter flying past that point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.32,0:16:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which was making us misjudge the distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.66,0:16:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm betting this trick was set up on purpose,\Nto keep anyone from getting too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.30,0:16:34.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuroyata!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.30,0:16:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.20,0:16:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.11,0:16:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.03,0:16:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said there were a bunch of\Nwhat seemed to be lookouts,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.78,0:16:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they went inside to get\Narrows when they spotted him,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.24,0:16:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so this would be a good time to go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.98,0:16:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't afford to pass up this\Nchance that Kuroyata set up for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.38,0:16:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One and two!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.52,0:17:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cold in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.32,0:17:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.23,0:17:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's enormous!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.60,0:17:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.96,0:17:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why aren't they reacting?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.24,0:17:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They look like they're\Nwaiting for instructions
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.04,0:17:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the commander here\Nhas already been captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.96,0:17:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes sense it lines\Nup with what director
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.00,0:17:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,scorching told us maybe\Nthe commander is a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.90,0:17:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To make us lower our\Nguard while they build up
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.16,0:17:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their forces and make plans\Nto attack the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.48,0:17:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would certainly\Nexplain this situation wait
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.64,0:17:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a sec i just thought of a\Nway to turn this around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.78,0:17:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On him, here goes nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.38,0:17:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nice
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.78,0:17:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.69,0:17:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,plan's working heavy's using his
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.26,0:17:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,illusions to make These monsters\Nthink that their buddies are us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.10,0:17:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to take this new\Ngear out on a test run.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.24,0:18:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's start by getting heavier.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.22,0:18:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.60,0:18:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was surprisingly effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.70,0:18:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like Field will be able\Nto save up quite a bit of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.06,0:18:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the easy part.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.14,0:18:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we've got to deal with any\Nambushes or traps waiting ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.78,0:18:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Voxo, do you think you could go in front?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.46,0:18:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your barrier is probably\Ngoing to come in handy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.06,0:18:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.42,0:18:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be right there with you. Hey, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.24,0:18:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't mean to interrupt\Nwhile you're making plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.92,0:18:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But do you think I could have seconds?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.92,0:18:37.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've still got a back-ish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.20,0:18:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Voxo, be ready for anything\Nfrom this point forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.60,0:18:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.34,0:18:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.22,0:18:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.56,0:19:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, you can come up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.56,0:19:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter, Hulemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.54,0:19:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking that if whoever set\Nthese traps knew what we were doing to them,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.44,0:19:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'd be pretty mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.90,0:19:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.02,0:19:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it were me, I don't\Nknow if I could handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.66,0:19:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears there are enemies\Nwaiting beyond the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.58,0:19:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.49,0:19:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Llamas, go ahead and\Nbust it wide open. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.82,0:19:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock, knock!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.26,0:19:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like they were\Nlurking behind the door
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.12,0:19:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they could pounce on\Nus the second it opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.38,0:19:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They definitely weren't expecting that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.90,0:19:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must be the Billowing Flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.26,0:19:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell do you guys\Nthink you are? That man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.80,0:19:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He matches the description\Nwe were given for Tashtay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.54,0:19:44.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.45,0:19:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.37,0:19:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're a group of hunters who came\Nhere from the Clearflow Lake Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.28,0:19:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you're from another stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.28,0:19:52.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.88,0:19:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you must know, the reason we came is to\Ndiscuss some important business with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.00,0:20:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we received more of a\Nwelcome than we expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.94,0:20:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to talk business?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.76,0:20:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to tell us how\Nthe hell you found out that we
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.34,0:20:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were hiding monsters in here\Nso we could attack the village?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.46,0:20:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure enough, that was\Ntheir plan all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.38,0:20:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, I'd appreciate it if you\Ncleared something up for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.42,0:20:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.33,0:20:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your group has been conspiring\Nwith the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.16,0:20:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's the reason why you've been able
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.06,0:20:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to control the monsters\Non the first floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.50,0:20:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that just about sum everything up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.84,0:20:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you already know that much,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.68,0:20:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I suppose there's no\Npoint in trying to play dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.46,0:20:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's only temporary, but\Nwe're working with the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.94,0:20:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why are you on the Demon Lord's side?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.20,0:20:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're only hurting innocent people!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.82,0:20:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.26,0:20:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could spare me all\Nthat goody-two-shoes talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.72,0:20:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're doing it for money, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.46,0:20:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a no-brainer when we're getting enough\Nmoney that we never have to work again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.46,0:20:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the way you're talking,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.76,0:20:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it sounds as if you're quite comfortable
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.26,0:20:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with doing illegal\Nthings for personal gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.26,0:20:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got a problem with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.00,0:20:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robberies, rapes, and even murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.78,0:20:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It all blends together after a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.06,0:21:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you expect from a former bandit?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.92,0:21:03.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.83,0:21:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's nothing that feels\Nbetter than trampling
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.68,0:21:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,over a weakling while they beg for mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.76,0:21:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.26,0:21:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.56,0:21:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These guys are total scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.56,0:21:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I suspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.46,0:21:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case, do\Nyou recognize these boots?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.10,0:21:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are they supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.14,0:21:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.26,0:21:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't those the boots we sold\Nfor a pretty penny a while back?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.66,0:21:26.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.57,0:21:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stole them off of that hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.28,0:21:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.82,0:21:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That chick was going on about\Nhow she'd never hand them over
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.80,0:21:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no matter what because she got\Nthem from someone dear to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.22,0:21:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was pissing me off, so\NI cut off her freaking legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.80,0:21:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.36,0:21:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.02,0:21:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At last, I get to achieve my goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.76,0:21:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've prayed for this moment countless\Ntimes, and now it's finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.54,0:21:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how\NI've longed to find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.96,0:21:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may beg me for forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.30,0:21:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may cry from the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.50,0:22:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may even attempt to repent,\Nbut none of it will save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.64,0:22:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.32,0:22:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.78,0:22:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.18,0:22:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.34,0:22:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.84,0:22:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not looking at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.24,0:22:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.72,0:23:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.02,0:23:40.02,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (upper left),0,0,0,,{\pos(50,60)\fs14}Next Time
